> MAM[AD]OU[ S]AKHO remains unavailable for[ selection] for[ Liverpool]'s Europa League[ semi]-[final][ first][ leg][ clash] with[ Vill]ar[real][ in][ Spain][ on] Thursday[ (][8][.]05[pm][).]
